    # prior>1 ⇒ another live binding still holds it ⇒ only relinquish our reference.
    # Mirrors mir_emit_cow_release's accounting + the C3.6/h5 extend retain loop shape.
    # The flatness rail (mir_value_is_cow_layout) guarantees no nested cow-ptr field;
    # nested ref-handle-field Drop on collection-drop is a filed follow-up (rare, not
    # generatable from codegen here). cow stride is 8 (one ptr/slot). INERT at gate 0:
    # mir_prog_struct_is_cow_layout returns 0 when mir_value_cow_live()==0 ⇒ block
    # skipped ⇒ byte-identical IR.
